{"2995100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DeadWire", "steam_appid": 2995100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3997130], "detailed_description": "<h1>NEW LOWERED PRICE</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadwire is now 100% Independent! To celebrate, we've <strong>permanently lowered the price</strong> to $9.99 and added a free Arena Mode game mode.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DeadWire</strong> lets you hack enemies and objects to create chain reactions and multi-kills. Play slow and tactical, or go in guns blazing with no ragrets. Your choice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/6c61dfc3db7069635ab02892ddb71b85.poster.avif?t=1786271701\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/6c61dfc3db7069635ab02892ddb71b85.webm?t=1786271701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/6c61dfc3db7069635ab02892ddb71b85.mp4?t=1786271701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chain Reaction Carnage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the high-tech world of <strong>DeadWire</strong>, you can hack enemies and link them to each other and nearby objects, causing deadly chain reactions that turn the environment into a weapon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix fast shooting, power-ups, and a unique hacking (ReWire) ability</strong> to help you defeat enemies and complete your mission. Use the hack view to spot opportunities, plan your approach, or dive in guns blazing. And if things go wrong, restart and try a new strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/5b7f8c7b82ecd2ec8596332426b5bb5d.poster.avif?t=1786271701\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/5b7f8c7b82ecd2ec8596332426b5bb5d.webm?t=1786271701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/5b7f8c7b82ecd2ec8596332426b5bb5d.mp4?t=1786271701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/069279ed1cf87c5ed6190c90e59a1806.poster.avif?t=1786271701\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/069279ed1cf87c5ed6190c90e59a1806.webm?t=1786271701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/069279ed1cf87c5ed6190c90e59a1806.mp4?t=1786271701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ levels and 80+ side objectives - </strong>Hours of handcrafted missions built for challenge and replayability. Unlock cheats, weapons, and modifiers  as you complete side objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack the World -</strong> Almost everything can be linked. Chain enemies together, overload cars, toggle lasers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons on Weapons -</strong> Pistols, smart rifles, shotguns, railguns, cyber grenades and more. Mix hacking with firepower for maximum chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side-Objectives, Time Trials</strong> <strong>and Score Mode</strong> - Creative solutions are rewarded! Beat time trials, finish side objectives, and chase high scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Electronic Soundtrack -</strong> Dirty basslines and heavy drums bring the cyberpunk city to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/eb29580aa62241a50e1eac490f23fd28.poster.avif?t=1786271701\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/eb29580aa62241a50e1eac490f23fd28.webm?t=1786271701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/eb29580aa62241a50e1eac490f23fd28.mp4?t=1786271701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So to sum it all up:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadwire is designed to challenge (but it's not impossible)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use weapons and your hacking ability to turn the odds in your favor</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is a mix of fast shooting and slower combat puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a story but it's not story driven</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability through side objectives, time trials and score mode</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DeadWire</strong> lets you hack enemies and objects to create chain reactions and multi-kills. Play slow and tactical, or go in guns blazing with no ragrets. Your choice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/6c61dfc3db7069635ab02892ddb71b85.poster.avif?t=1786271701\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/6c61dfc3db7069635ab02892ddb71b85.webm?t=1786271701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/6c61dfc3db7069635ab02892ddb71b85.mp4?t=1786271701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chain Reaction Carnage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the high-tech world of <strong>DeadWire</strong>, you can hack enemies and link them to each other and nearby objects, causing deadly chain reactions that turn the environment into a weapon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix fast shooting, power-ups, and a unique hacking (ReWire) ability</strong> to help you defeat enemies and complete your mission. Use the hack view to spot opportunities, plan your approach, or dive in guns blazing. And if things go wrong, restart and try a new strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/5b7f8c7b82ecd2ec8596332426b5bb5d.poster.avif?t=1786271701\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/5b7f8c7b82ecd2ec8596332426b5bb5d.webm?t=1786271701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/5b7f8c7b82ecd2ec8596332426b5bb5d.mp4?t=1786271701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/069279ed1cf87c5ed6190c90e59a1806.poster.avif?t=1786271701\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/069279ed1cf87c5ed6190c90e59a1806.webm?t=1786271701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/069279ed1cf87c5ed6190c90e59a1806.mp4?t=1786271701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ levels and 80+ side objectives - </strong>Hours of handcrafted missions built for challenge and replayability. Unlock cheats, weapons, and modifiers  as you complete side objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack the World -</strong> Almost everything can be linked. Chain enemies together, overload cars, toggle lasers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons on Weapons -</strong> Pistols, smart rifles, shotguns, railguns, cyber grenades and more. Mix hacking with firepower for maximum chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side-Objectives, Time Trials</strong> <strong>and Score Mode</strong> - Creative solutions are rewarded! Beat time trials, finish side objectives, and chase high scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Electronic Soundtrack -</strong> Dirty basslines and heavy drums bring the cyberpunk city to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/eb29580aa62241a50e1eac490f23fd28.poster.avif?t=1786271701\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/eb29580aa62241a50e1eac490f23fd28.webm?t=1786271701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/extras/eb29580aa62241a50e1eac490f23fd28.mp4?t=1786271701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So to sum it all up:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadwire is designed to challenge (but it's not impossible)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use weapons and your hacking ability to turn the odds in your favor</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is a mix of fast shooting and slower combat puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a story but it's not story driven</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability through side objectives, time trials and score mode</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Use weapons and your hacking ability to trigger chain reactions by linking enemies and the environment in clever ways. Shoot, stab, throw grenades, hack, or whatever it takes to kill everyone and save yourself and your mentor.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "reviews": "“There are plenty of cyberpunk games which allow you to use hacking in combat, but few with such immediate, explosive consequences”<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>“It feels absolutely badass to use your hacking powers in varied violent ways, and I’m looking forward to causing a lot of damage with them. When I think of hacking in games I think of puzzle mini games, but Deadwire’s hacking focus is so much more than this”<br>Loot Level Chill<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/header.jpg?t=1786271701", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/ae9906c89c5f147aa7629521d0b8cb28f3f637be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786271701", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995100/ae9906c89c5f147aa7629521d0b8cb28f3f637be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786271701", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2125, AMD Phenom II X4 960 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 MB VRAM, Radeon Vega 7/GTX 1030/Intel Iris 550 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 3 3300X or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512 MB VRAM, RX 460/GTX 1050/Iris Xe DG1 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Zen 2 4c/8t, 2.4-3.5GHz (Steamdeck)<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 RDNA 2 CUs, 1.6GHz </li></ul>"}, "developers": ["Shotgun Anaconda"], "publishers": ["Shotgun Anaconda"], "demos": [{"appid": 3438440, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 999, "final": 999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$9.99"}, "packages": [1065654], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy DeadWire", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1065654, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "DeadWire - $9.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 999}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 18, "description": "Partial Controller Support"}, {"id": 23, "des